/-
Subadditivity of the function q(x,y) = y^2/(x^3+xy) on the domain x>0, |y|<x^2.
-/
theorem symmetric_ratio_inequality (x y x' y' : ℝ)
    (hx : x > 0) (hy : abs y < x ^ 2)
    (hx' : x' > 0) (hy' : abs y' < x' ^ 2) :
